<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Real Estate - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Real Estate - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 27.12		vs	   19.33</p>
<p> Operating	    1.82		vs	    1.52</p>
<p> Current	    501    mln	  vs	  360    mln</p>
<p> Net		  486    mln	  vs	  229    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    9.02 yen	  vs	    4.26 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     54 million	  vs	  54 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsui Real Estate Sales Co Ltd sells houses and condominiums and is a subsidiary of Mitsui Fudosan Co Ltd.</p>
